      "version": "1.0.6",
      "description": "<h3>Added</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Quick Loot now merges items onto a stack in your inventory</li>\n</ul>\n<p>but only if a mod is present adding the ability to stack that item</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Quick Sort now merges items into a stack</li>\n</ul>\n<p>but only if a mod is present adding the ability to stack that item</p>\n<h3>Changed</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Sort start delay raised from 0.3s to 3.0s so the warning is readable before anything moves.</li>\n<li>Warning and completion notifications rewritten</li>\n<li>Item ordering during sort is now area descending,</li>\n</ul>\n",
